        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/sherrard-192882",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Kinsey’s Garage once sold Fords and Case tractors, later Chevrolets, reflecting Sherrard’s early automotive trade.",
